  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Shadow Song** (1 other source): Uploader boosted this track's volume to twice its original level [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Commandate**: back after 23 archived shows (970 days) [4]\n- **Stars Around Her**: back after 47 archived shows (2915 days); rare: 5 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2004-02-18** (recommended): source not stated; 15 songs; 54 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- John Darnielle played guitar and sang, Peter Hughes played bass; The Rosebuds and Phosphorescent opened. Uploader says the set is complete [1]\n- A drunk audience member, the reviewer, can be heard yelling throughout the recording [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2004-02-18**: taped by Brandon; transferred by Brandon; source: mini-cardioid stereo microphones>Sharp MD-MT90 minidisc recorder>SoundBlaster PCI128 sound card [1]. Also: Uploader edited the recording in Cool Edit Pro, adjusting volume and adding fades and other edits [1]",
